{"id":"o-americanalpineclub-org","claimKey":"b6eaf1b40949c504c8ac096618288a555bfc1c2a1ba5d372cdae87e67ec8216e","title":"Rumney Rattlesnake Campground","cat":"outdoor","art":"camping","area":"NH","metroId":"","src":"americanalpineclub.org","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Crash Pad Rentals","detail":"","price":10,"per":"/day"},{"name":"American Alpine Club Membership","detail":"Join the Club today","price":45},{"name":"“Frequent Flyer” Scan Package","detail":"Standard","price":200},{"name":"Climbing Books","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Gunks Campground","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Bunkhouse (6-Person Co-Ed Room)","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"2026-2027 Program Schedule & Dates","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"Crash Pad Rentals","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55830fd9e4b0ec758c892f81/6737fe2a-1431-4bec-936f-c7ff260627fb/011226_LT11_AAC_Hueco_Tanks_LR-6864.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":10,"per":"/day","optionIdx":0}]},{"name":"“Frequent Flyer” Scan Package","desc":null,"variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":200,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Climbing Books","desc":"Essential knowledge for safety and inspiration. Club members enjoy printed or digital annual editions of two of climbing’s most historic and treasured publications: Accidents in North American Climbing and The American Alpine Journal. These books capture in-depth accident analysis and cutting edge ascents,","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55830fd9e4b0ec758c892f81/1cc05e8e-2c1f-4743-8abd-b5b2440354cc/20121129-indiancreekroadtrip-0006.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":3}]},{"name":"Gunks Campground","desc":"In 2006, the Mohonk Preserve, New York State Office of Parks, Recreation, and Historic Preservation, the Palisades Interstate Park Commission, and the American Alpine Club partnered together to create a campground near the popular Shawangunks climbing area. Construction was completed in 2014 by The Palisades Interstate Park Commission, and now The American Alpine Club and The Mohonk Preserve operate and manage 50 campsites and 6 vehicle sites, all within a stone's throw of miles of world-class rock climbing. This is a watershed moment for one of the most popular rock-climbing areas in the country. For the first time since climbing in the “Gunks” began over 80 years ago, hot showers and","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55830fd9e4b0ec758c892f81/84005131-f4bf-4aac-af73-8617a07eb9c5/FLEBEAU_2018_10_Gunks-3520.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":4}]},{"name":"Bunkhouse (6-Person Co-Ed Room)","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55830fd9e4b0ec758c892f81/1771544636182-T1F8ODUWF7ZJUXP5OBQJ/IMG_20221001_102333_447.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":5}]},{"name":"2026-2027 Program Schedule & Dates","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55830fd9e4b0ec758c892f81/09cb4864-aabf-4ca4-a96b-27125abcf252/july-2026-prescription-anchor-fall.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":6}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[{"name":"- Upgrade","detail":"","price":300}],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"The AAC Rumney Rattlesnake Campground sits on a 15-acre parcel right off the Baker River and within walking distance of popular crags at Rumney Rocks. It’s a great escape from the city and the quickest approach in the area. The campground is communal, and campers may set up their tents wherever they feel most comfortable. We have 16 communal fire rings and picnic tables for guests to share.","cover":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55830fd9e4b0ec758c892f81/142793ad-22d3-4f29-9d63-b91551166c04/Pancake%2BFlake%2BHeinz%2Bwide%2B-%2BLynn%2BHill.webp?format=2500w","photos":["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/